Z||000002||cmc||07-30-2001||07:56 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hodaka:<BR><B>after i run my car for a little the exhaust manifold starts glowing red hot?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The two most common explanations for this are:<P>1. Your catalytic convertor is clogged.<BR>2. You're running pretty lean.||||reg||1
